{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54382","headline":"临化偈 二 · 玄泰","name":"临化偈 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不同[剃]（涕）（从《五灯会元》改）头，不用澡浴。\n一堆猛火，千足万足。\n（见《祖堂集》卷九、《五灯会元》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"玄泰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}